# dx build output. The root .gitignore's `/dist` only anchors to the repo
# root, not this crate subdir, so it never actually covered this directory
# — this file closes that gap. Build it with `./scripts/build-ui.sh` (from
# the repo root) — `crates/oxidarr-prowl`'s `ui` cargo feature requires
# this directory to already exist and embeds it at compile time; see that
# crate's `src/ui.rs` module docs and `build.rs`, and this repo's
# README.md "Web UI" section.
/dist
